    "description": "<p>You conjure forth countless fragments of flexible steel, wrapping them around your body to form a massive suit of armor.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Armor</strong>, <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Size</strong> increase by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 round</strong>s.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase your <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p>You may also increase your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Size</strong> together by <strong>+1</strong> per 4 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.OKtfiv38FQ5lr1sM]{Steel Titan}</p>",
